      "message": "nit: would it make sense to do this after the below `if` (i.e. before pkvm_vcpu_update_state_from_host())? i.e. after we already checked that the vCPU is allowed to run (`READ_ONCE(vcpu-\u003earch.mp_state) !\u003d KVM_MP_STATE_RUNNABLE`) and are about to actually run it?",
